<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.1/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="/css/style.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #006633 0%, #004d26 50%, #003319 100%); min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; }
    .feature-icon { width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.5rem; }
    .step-number { width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.2rem; border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }
    .hover-card { transition: transform 0.2s; }
    .hover-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Navbar -->
  <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark" style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);">
    <div class="container">
      <a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center gap-2" href="/">
        <i class="bi bi-display-fill fs-4 text-warning"></i>
        <div>
          <span class="fw-bold">AulaCheck</span>
          <small class="d-block text-white-50" style="font-size:0.65rem;line-height:1">Universidad Veracruzana</small>
        </div>
      </a>
      <div class="ms-auto d-flex gap-2">
        <a href="/auth/login" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm px-3">
          <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right me-1"></i>Iniciar Sesión
        </a>
        <a href="/auth/register" class="btn btn-warning btn-sm text-dark fw-semibold px-3">
          <i class="bi bi-person-plus me-1"></i>Registrarse
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="py-5 mt-2">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
        <div class="col-lg-6">
          <div class="mb-3">
            <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark px-3 py-2">
              <i class="bi bi-mortarboard me-1"></i> Universidad Veracruzana
            </span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold text-white mb-2">AulaCheck</h1>
          <h2 class="text-warning fw-light mb-4" style="font-size:1.4rem">Sistema de Diagnóstico de Aulas Híbridas</h2>
          <p class="text-white fs-5 mb-4" style="opacity:0.85">
            Detecta, reporta y resuelve fallas en el equipamiento tecnológico.
            Mantén tus clases funcionando sin interrupciones.
          </p>
          <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-4">
            <a href="/auth/login" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold px-4">
              <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right me-2"></i>Iniciar Sesión
            </a>
            <a href="/auth/register" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg px-4">
              <i class="bi bi-person-plus me-2"></i>Crear Cuenta
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="d-flex gap-4 text-white">
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="fw-bold text-warning fs-3">5+</div>
              <small class="text-white-50">Aulas Monitoreadas</small>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="fw-bold text-warning fs-3">3</div>
              <small class="text-white-50">Roles de Usuario</small>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="fw-bold text-warning fs-3">24/7</div>
              <small class="text-white-50">Seguimiento</small>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6">
          <div class="mx-auto bg-white bg-opacity-10 p-4 rounded-4" style="border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); max-width: 420px;">
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
              <div class="bg-danger rounded-circle" style="width:12px;height:12px"></div>
              <div class="bg-warning rounded-circle" style="width:12px;height:12px"></div>
              <div class="bg-success rounded-circle" style="width:12px;height:12px"></div>
              <span class="text-white-50 ms-2 small">Panel AulaCheck</span>
            </div>
            <div class="row g-2 mb-3">
              <div class="col-6">
                <div class="bg-success bg-opacity-25 rounded-3 p-3 text-center" style="border: 1px solid rgba(25,135,84,0.3)">
                  <div class="text-success fw-bold fs-3">12</div>
                  <small class="text-white-50">Operativos</small>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-6">
                <div class="bg-danger bg-opacity-25 rounded-3 p-3 text-center" style="border: 1px solid rgba(220,53,69,0.3)">
                  <div class="text-danger fw-bold fs-3">3</div>
                  <small class="text-white-50">Con Falla</small>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white bg-opacity-10 rounded-3 p-3 mb-2">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                <i class="bi bi-projector text-warning"></i>
                <span class="text-white small">Proyector Aula H101</span>
                <span class="badge bg-danger ms-auto">Crítico</span>
              </div>
              <div class="progress" style="height:4px"><div class="progress-bar bg-warning" style="width:65%"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white bg-opacity-10 rounded-3 p-3 mb-2">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                <i class="bi bi-mic text-info"></i>
                <span class="text-white small">Micrófono Lab Cómputo</span>
                <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark ms-auto">Media</span>
              </div>
              <div class="progress" style="height:4px"><div class="progress-bar bg-info" style="width:40%"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center mt-3">
              <small class="text-white-50"><i class="bi bi-shield-check text-success me-1"></i>3 incidencias resueltas hoy</small>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features Section -->
  <section class="py-5" style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2)">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <h2 class="fw-bold text-white">Todo lo que necesitas</h2>
        <p class="text-white-50">Herramientas diseñadas para mantener tus aulas funcionando al máximo</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="card h-100 text-white hover-card" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">
            <div class="card-body p-4">
              <div class="feature-icon bg-warning bg-opacity-25 text-warning mb-3">
                <i class="bi bi-clipboard-check"></i>
              </div>
              <h5 class="fw-bold">Diagnóstico Guiado</h5>
              <p class="text-white-50 mb-0">Wizard interactivo para verificar el estado de cada equipo antes de clases. Sin conocimientos técnicos.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="card h-100 text-white hover-card" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">
            <div class="card-body p-4">
              <div class="feature-icon bg-info bg-opacity-25 text-info mb-3">
                <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle"></i>
              </div>
              <h5 class="fw-bold">Reporte de Incidencias</h5>
              <p class="text-white-50 mb-0">Reporta fallas en segundos. El equipo técnico recibe notificación inmediata con seguimiento en tiempo real.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="card h-100 text-white hover-card" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">
            <div class="card-body p-4">
              <div class="feature-icon bg-success bg-opacity-25 text-success mb-3">
                <i class="bi bi-bar-chart-line"></i>
              </div>
              <h5 class="fw-bold">Estadísticas Avanzadas</h5>
              <p class="text-white-50 mb-0">Visualiza tendencias de fallas, tiempos de resolución y equipos más problemáticos con gráficas interactivas.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How it Works -->
  <section class="py-5">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <h2 class="fw-bold text-white">¿Cómo funciona?</h2>
        <p class="text-white-50">Tres pasos simples para mantener tus aulas al 100%</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row g-4 justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
          <div class="step-number mx-auto mb-3 text-white fs-4">1</div>
          <h5 class="text-white fw-bold">Diagnóstica</h5>
          <p class="text-white-50">Al llegar al aula, ejecuta el diagnóstico rápido. Verifica cámara, micrófono, proyector e internet en 2 minutos.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
          <div class="step-number mx-auto mb-3 text-white fs-4">2</div>
          <h5 class="text-white fw-bold">Reporta</h5>
          <p class="text-white-50">Si detectas una falla, repórtala con un clic. El sistema notifica automáticamente al equipo técnico con prioridad.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
          <div class="step-number mx-auto mb-3 text-white fs-4">3</div>
          <h5 class="text-white fw-bold">Resuelve</h5>
          <p class="text-white-50">Los técnicos atienden la incidencia, añaden notas de seguimiento y cierran el ticket cuando está resuelto.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-5" style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3)">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h2 class="fw-bold text-white mb-3">¿Listo para empezar?</h2>
      <p class="text-white-50 mb-4">Únete al sistema de diagnóstico de aulas de la Universidad Veracruzana</p>
      <div class="d-flex gap-3 justify-content-center flex-wrap">
        <a href="/auth/login" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold px-5">
          <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right me-2"></i>Iniciar Sesión
        </a>
        <a href="/auth/register" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg px-5">
          <i class="bi bi-person-plus me-2"></i>Registrarse
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="py-4 text-center text-white-50" style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1)">
    <small>AulaCheck &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> — Universidad Veracruzana | Sistema de Diagnóstico de Aulas Híbridas</small>
  </footer>

  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
